   "parent": -2070149534,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "This was such a nice escape... I’ll miss the quiet here.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1483452083": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -2070149534,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "It’s hard to say goodbye to this place, but I guess all good things have to end.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "139501129": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -2070149534,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Do you think we’ll ever find another spot as cozy as this?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "841545856": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -2070149534,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I’m really glad we came here. It was exactly what I needed.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1566726603": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -2070149534,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "It feels like we just got here, and now it’s already time to leave.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "821276207": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -2070149534,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Next time, I’ll make sure to pack even better... I don’t want to forget anything.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "969068297": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -2070149534,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Let’s head back... and maybe start planning the next adventure.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  }
